"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["不花钱。把照护的活分出去一部分，自己去做一次体检。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["研究是前瞻性人群队列，1993 到 1998 年，平均随访 4.5 年，在美国四个社区做。392 名照护者和 427 名非照护者，年龄 66 到 96 岁，都与配偶同住。四年内 103 人（12.6%）死亡。调整社会人口学因素、已有疾病和亚临床心血管疾病之后，一边照护一边报告有精神或情绪紧张的人，死亡风险比非照护对照高 63%（RR 1.63，95% CI 1.00–2.65，可信范围）。照护但未报告紧张的人（RR 1.08，95% CI 0.61–1.90）和配偶失能但本人不照护的人（RR 1.37，95% CI 0.73–2.58），调整后的死亡率都没有升高"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原始出处"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Schulz R, Beach SR (1999). Caregiving as a risk factor for mortality: the Caregiver Health Effects Study. JAMA, 282(23):2215-2219. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1001/jama.282.23.2215","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1001/jama.282.23.2215"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1001/jama.282.23.2215","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["打开来源链接"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["争议：这项研究的可信范围下限正好压在 1.00 上，「没有差别」这个可能性没有被完全排除。人群是与配偶同住的美国老人，照护对象是失能的老年配偶，套到照护年轻残疾家属的人身上属于往外推。它能说明的是方向：吃力的那部分人风险更高。能分出去的照护活尽量分出去，托养和日间照料服务问当地残联和民政。照护者自己的慢性病别停药，见第 16 节第 1 条（药按医嘱吃满）。这条的受益人是你自己。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/33-03"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"精神障碍住院以自愿为原则，只有两种情形可以不经本人同意"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/33-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"长期坐轮椅的，坐垫换成减压型，每天看一遍坐骨和尾骨"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/33-01"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"chi